{
    "title": "MyNISSAN\u00ae",
    "description": "The MyNISSAN App is designed to help you get the most out of your vehicle and overall ownership experience. It brings remote access, security, personalization, vehicle information, maintenance, and convenience features from your Nissan to your compatible Android phone or Wear OS.\r\nThe MyNISSAN App is available for use by all Nissan owners, though the experience has been optimized for vehicles 2014 and later. The complete MyNISSAN experience is available for owners with an active NissanConnect\u00ae Services Premium package, on select models 2018 and newer.* For a complete list of available features for your specific vehicle, visit owners.nissanusa.com\r\nThe following MyNISSAN features are available to all Nissan owners and vehicles:\r\n\u2022 Manage your Nissan account and preferences\r\n\u2022 Make a service appointment with your preferred dealer****\r\n\u2022 Receive notifications for applicable vehicle recalls or service campaigns\r\n\u2022 View your vehicle\u2019s service history and maintenance schedule\r\n\u2022 Connect to Roadside Assistance\r\nWith a compatible vehicle, you can:\r\n\u2022 Remotely start and stop your vehicle**, lock and unlock vehicle doors, and activate horn and lights\r\n\u2022 Search for, save and send points of interest to your vehicle\r\n\u2022 Check vehicle status (doors, engine, mileage, remaining fuel range, tire pressure, oil pressure, airbags, brakes)\r\n\u2022 Locate your vehicle\r\n\u2022 Keep tabs on your vehicle with customizable boundary, speed and curfew alerts***\r\nVehicle trims with Google built-in** have additional accessibility, including: \r\n\u2022 Remote vehicle climate adjustment \r\n\u2022 Remote engine start \r\n\u2022 Receive notifications if you\u2019ve left your vehicle with doors unlocked, windows cracked, and more\r\n\u2022 Connect with your automotive repair shop to receive real-time updates\r\n\u2022 Simplify your trip with data-based route planning\r\n\u2022 Receive alerts ahead of time if vehicle maintenance is coming due\r\n\u2022 Add up to four additional drivers on one Nissan ID account\r\n\r\nFor important safety information, system limitations, and additional operating and feature information, see dealer, owner\u2019s manual, or www.nissanusa.com/connect/privacy.\r\n*The NissanConnect Services telematics program was affected by AT&T\u2019s decision to discontinue its 3G cellular network. As of February 22, 2022, all Nissan vehicles equipped with telematics hardware compatible for use with the 3G cellular network will be unable to connect to the 3G network and unable to access the NissanConnect Services features. Customers having purchased a Nissan vehicle with this type of hardware must have enrolled in NissanConnect Services prior to June 1, 2021, to activate the service to have received access through February 22, 2022 (access is subject to cellular network availability and coverage limitations). For more information, please visit http://www.nissanusa.com/connect/support-faqs.\r\n**Feature availability varies by vehicle model year, model, trim level, packaging and options. Consumer activation of NissanConnect Services SELECT package (\"Package\") required. Package trial period included with eligible new vehicle purchase or lease.  Trial period may be subject to change or termination at any time and without notice.  After trial period ends, monthly subscription fee required. Driving is serious business and requires your full attention. Only use features when safe and legal to do so. Never program while driving. GPS mapping may not be detailed in all areas or reflect current road status. Connectivity service required. App subscriptions may be required. Data rates may apply. Subject to third party service availability. Should such service providers terminate or restrict service or features, service or features may be suspended or terminated without notice or with no liability to NISSAN or its partners or agents. Google, Google Play and Google Maps are trademarks of Google LLC. For more information, see www.nissanusa.com/connect/legal.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The MyNISSAN App is designed to help you get the most out of your vehicle and overall ownership experience. It brings remote access, security, personalization, vehicle information, maintenance, and convenience features from your Nissan to your compatible Android phone or Wear OS.<br>The MyNISSAN App is available for use by all Nissan owners, though the experience has been optimized for vehicles 2014 and later. The complete MyNISSAN experience is available for owners with an active NissanConnect\u00ae Services Premium package, on select models 2018 and newer.* For a complete list of available features for your specific vehicle, visit owners.nissanusa.com<br>The following MyNISSAN features are available to all Nissan owners and vehicles:<br>\u2022 Manage your Nissan account and preferences<br>\u2022 Make a service appointment with your preferred dealer****<br>\u2022 Receive notifications for applicable vehicle recalls or service campaigns<br>\u2022 View your vehicle\u2019s service history and maintenance schedule<br>\u2022 Connect to Roadside Assistance<br>With a compatible vehicle, you can:<br>\u2022 Remotely start and stop your vehicle**, lock and unlock vehicle doors, and activate horn and lights<br>\u2022 Search for, save and send points of interest to your vehicle<br>\u2022 Check vehicle status (doors, engine, mileage, remaining fuel range, tire pressure, oil pressure, airbags, brakes)<br>\u2022 Locate your vehicle<br>\u2022 Keep tabs on your vehicle with customizable boundary, speed and curfew alerts***<br>Vehicle trims with Google built-in** have additional accessibility, including: <br>\u2022 Remote vehicle climate adjustment <br>\u2022 Remote engine start <br>\u2022 Receive notifications if you\u2019ve left your vehicle with doors unlocked, windows cracked, and more<br>\u2022 Connect with your automotive repair shop to receive real-time updates<br>\u2022 Simplify your trip with data-based route planning<br>\u2022 Receive alerts ahead of time if vehicle maintenance is coming due<br>\u2022 Add up to four additional drivers on one Nissan ID account<br><br>For important safety information, system limitations, and additional operating and feature information, see dealer, owner\u2019s manual, or www.nissanusa.com/connect/privacy.<br>*The NissanConnect Services telematics program was affected by AT&amp;T\u2019s decision to discontinue its 3G cellular network. As of February 22, 2022, all Nissan vehicles equipped with telematics hardware compatible for use with the 3G cellular network will be unable to connect to the 3G network and unable to access the NissanConnect Services features. Customers having purchased a Nissan vehicle with this type of hardware must have enrolled in NissanConnect Services prior to June 1, 2021, to activate the service to have received access through February 22, 2022 (access is subject to cellular network availability and coverage limitations). For more information, please visit http://www.nissanusa.com/connect/support-faqs.<br>**Feature availability varies by vehicle model year, model, trim level, packaging and options. Consumer activation of NissanConnect Services SELECT package (&quot;Package&quot;) required. Package trial period included with eligible new vehicle purchase or lease.  Trial period may be subject to change or termination at any time and without notice.  After trial period ends, monthly subscription fee required. Driving is serious business and requires your full attention. Only use features when safe and legal to do so. Never program while driving. GPS mapping may not be detailed in all areas or reflect current road status. Connectivity service required. App subscriptions may be required. Data rates may apply. Subject to third party service availability. Should such service providers terminate or restrict service or features, service or features may be suspended or terminated without notice or with no liability to NISSAN or its partners or agents. Google, Google Play and Google Maps are trademarks of Google LLC. For more information, see www.nissanusa.com/connect/legal.",
